          "text": "Témoignages: MAISONS-ALFORT (94) 05.07.2020",
          "text_sha256": "2fc864727bd43d60fa81c9dbff89d7aee3236fc90e0a514c361c9ab833a00fa4"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
